    {
      "subId": "301101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nahida",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30111113"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30111113": {
            "id": "30111113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Um...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111103"
            ]
          },
          "30111103": {
            "id": "30111103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! Then the beep we hear every night could just be indicating the deletion of our memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111104"
            ]
          },
          "30111104": {
            "id": "30111104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's why when we wake up, everyone thinks the Sabzeruz Festival hasn't happened yet. It's already the next day, but everyone still thinks it's the day before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111105"
            ]
          },
          "30111105": {
            "id": "30111105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But muscle memory can't be erased. That's why Dehya has been getting better at using her greatsword! Now everything makes sense!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111106"
            ]
          },
          "30111106": {
            "id": "30111106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "...Hm, a brilliant deduction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111107"
            ]
          },
          "30111107": {
            "id": "30111107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nahida, tell us if we're right or wrong!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111108"
            ]
          },
          "30111108": {
            "id": "30111108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "To put it simply, it's as if you've mistaken a Pyro Crystalfly for a Firefly in the night. You lost sight of its true nature because you focused too much on your perception that it glows.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111109"
            ]
          },
          "30111109": {
            "id": "30111109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That isn't simple at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111110"
            ]
          },
          "30111110": {
            "id": "30111110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Still the wrong conclusion, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111111"
            ]
          },
          "30111111": {
            "id": "30111111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Why don't you go talk to Miss Dehya again? You might learn something new.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30111112"
            ]
          },
          "30111112": {
            "id": "30111112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right... She did help us find our latest clue, after all. Let's go!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301102",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dehya",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30110201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30110201": {
            "id": "30110201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "...There you are. Really took me a while to find you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110202"
            ]
          },
          "30110202": {
            "id": "30110202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As expected, Dehya also didn't get hurt today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110203"
            ]
          },
          "30110203": {
            "id": "30110203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Get hurt? Why would I? Don't underestimate me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110204"
            ]
          },
          "30110204": {
            "id": "30110204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, you're still getting used to your new greatsword...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110205"
            ]
          },
          "30110205": {
            "id": "30110205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Truth be told, I also think it's pretty strange. It just suddenly felt so familiar in my hands... Wait a sec, how did you know I got a new greatsword to begin with? I didn't tell anyone about it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110206"
            ]
          },
          "30110206": {
            "id": "30110206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Traveler, could you explain the situation to her today? Paimon's gotten a little sick of doing it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110209"
            ]
          },
          "30110209": {
            "id": "30110209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, that works.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110210"
            ]
          },
          "30110210": {
            "id": "30110210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You suddenly became proficient with your greatsword because..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301103",
      "subQuestName": "Go and check the evidence Dehya mentioned",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30110301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30110301": {
            "id": "30110301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "This is it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110302"
            ]
          },
          "30110302": {
            "id": "30110302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? This a wooden training dummy. What about it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110303"
            ]
          },
          "30110303": {
            "id": "30110303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "See those marks on the dummy? Those are the result of several days' worth of practice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110304"
            ]
          },
          "30110304": {
            "id": "30110304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Let's say the sages didn't replace it every day. Shouldn't it be hacked to pieces by now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110305"
            ]
          },
          "30110305": {
            "id": "30110305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's true, but what if they did?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110306"
            ]
          },
          "30110306": {
            "id": "30110306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Then the sages would have had to reproduce every mark I left during previous training sessions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110307"
            ]
          },
          "30110307": {
            "id": "30110307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "I'm a professional fighter. My martial school has always emphasized the importance of refined control.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110308"
            ]
          },
          "30110308": {
            "id": "30110308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "The force, angle, and entry point of each strike is calculated and deliberate. That's why I remember every mark on the dummy, as well as my state of mind as I made each strike.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110309"
            ]
          },
          "30110309": {
            "id": "30110309",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "It's just as they say: Each swordsman has their own unique style, and even the same swordsman can't make the same cut twice. It would be impossible to copy these marks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110310"
            ]
          },
          "30110310": {
            "id": "30110310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is it really impossible? What if they used some fancy machine to carve every single mark?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110311"
            ]
          },
          "30110311": {
            "id": "30110311",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "People often say that a Kamera's photo can never replace an artist's painting because the former has no spirit to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110312"
            ]
          },
          "30110312": {
            "id": "30110312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "The same thing applies here. At a mere glance, I can differentiate carved marks from the results of combat training.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110315"
            ]
          },
          "30110315": {
            "id": "30110315",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Phew... I hope that cleared things up for you? Hey, is this that new Brainsercise game that's been super popular with the scholars lately? It's surprisingly fun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110316"
            ]
          },
          "30110316": {
            "id": "30110316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Dehya",
            "text": "Anyway, it's getting late. I should escort Miss Dunyarzad to Nilou's stage. See ya later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110317"
            ]
          },
          "30110317": {
            "id": "30110317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Welp, back to square one. Is our memory deletion theory also wrong? *sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110318"
            ]
          },
          "30110318": {
            "id": "30110318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But at least we've reached some other conclusions in the meantime?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301104",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nahida",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30110401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30110401": {
            "id": "30110401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nahida, we're back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110402"
            ]
          },
          "30110402": {
            "id": "30110402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "You're back early today. Did you find something new?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110403"
            ]
          },
          "30110403": {
            "id": "30110403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sort of. We're mostly sure now that we're not in a time loop, and we also aren't in the real world. But at the same time, we have a new question...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110406"
            ]
          },
          "30110406": {
            "id": "30110406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Leaving the city... As far as I remember, you've mentioned your plans to do that twice before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110407"
            ]
          },
          "30110407": {
            "id": "30110407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110408"
            ]
          },
          "30110408": {
            "id": "30110408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We did? But we don't remember anything! What happened after we talked about those plans? What did we say when we got back?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110409"
            ]
          },
          "30110409": {
            "id": "30110409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Let me think... I don't think you ever actually told me what the outcome was. Oh — it's probably more accurate to say that both times, you never came back the whole night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110410"
            ]
          },
          "30110410": {
            "id": "30110410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "But you two sometimes stay out the entire night anyway, so at the time, I didn't think too much about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110411"
            ]
          },
          "30110411": {
            "id": "30110411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It is true that sometimes we lose track of time during our investigations. Before we know it, it'll already be the next day. But still... neither of us remember anything about leaving town.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110412"
            ]
          },
          "30110412": {
            "id": "30110412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Really? That's kinda strange. In theory, I should've already awakened all your memories."
          }
        }
      }
    },
