    {
      "subId": "300923",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30092301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30092301": {
            "id": "30092301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "We don't have many more festivals to waste. Hurry and find the truth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301101",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30110101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30110101": {
            "id": "30110101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...We're still in the same day!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110102"
            ]
          },
          "30110102": {
            "id": "30110102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "As expected, it's not as simple as we thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110103"
            ]
          },
          "30110103": {
            "id": "30110103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nahida, you already knew last night that we didn't break out of the samsara! Why didn't you tell us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110104"
            ]
          },
          "30110104": {
            "id": "30110104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Would there have been a point? You would've spent the night with new worries, with tomorrow still out of reach.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110105"
            ]
          },
          "30110105": {
            "id": "30110105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "In that case... You might as well rest within that brief moment of hope. An opportunity like that doesn't come by often, and I thought it might help you clear your minds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110106"
            ]
          },
          "30110106": {
            "id": "30110106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thought the dook-dook did that! Ah, whatever, guess you were looking out for us after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110107"
            ]
          },
          "30110107": {
            "id": "30110107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Hehe, of course. In the time we've been together, you two have been everything to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110108"
            ]
          },
          "30110108": {
            "id": "30110108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... Paimon's flattered and everything, but maybe you're taking things a little fast...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110109"
            ]
          },
          "30110109": {
            "id": "30110109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Hehehe... What I mean is, even though I had asked you to solve this puzzle, you two are still the only ones who can see me and sense my presence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110110"
            ]
          },
          "30110110": {
            "id": "30110110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "In other words, if you weren't here, I may as well not exist. That's why you two have been everything to me. Get it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110111"
            ]
          },
          "30110111": {
            "id": "30110111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh, Nahida's talking about confusing stuff again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110112"
            ]
          },
          "30110112": {
            "id": "30110112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "Anyway, that's enough chit-chat. So Traveler, did the new clues yesterday help you gain a new understanding of the situation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110113"
            ]
          },
          "30110113": {
            "id": "30110113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The time loop theory is indeed incorrect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110114"
            ]
          },
          "30110114": {
            "id": "30110114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Why are you scrapping your previous theory?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110117"
            ]
          },
          "30110117": {
            "id": "30110117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah, you're right. Gosh, how did we not notice that? In a simple time loop, people's physical conditions should also reset.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30110118"
            ]
          },
          "30110118": {
            "id": "30110118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "So, what's your new hypothesis?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "301199",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30119901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30119901": {
            "id": "30119901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon can't believe it's Dehya who wants to show us something this time. Two days ago, we were the ones taking her to see Dunyarzad...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119902"
            ]
          },
          "30119902": {
            "id": "30119902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Moon, illusions, and lies... What do they all mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119903"
            ]
          },
          "30119903": {
            "id": "30119903",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's happening right now seems to have happened before. This feeling has been getting stronger and stronger...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119904"
            ]
          },
          "30119904": {
            "id": "30119904",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Grand Sage said, \"Go celebrate the birth of that god to your heart's content.\" Did he mean something more?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119905"
            ]
          },
          "30119905": {
            "id": "30119905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Dehya sold her greatsword to raise additional funds, and she was injured because she wasn't used to her new weapon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119906"
            ]
          },
          "30119906": {
            "id": "30119906",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "My mind feels exhausted, even though I haven't done too much thinking. What is going on?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119907"
            ]
          },
          "30119907": {
            "id": "30119907",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We've already experienced the Sabzeruz Festival many times. And... the day of the festival seems to be in a perpetual samsara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119908"
            ]
          },
          "30119908": {
            "id": "30119908",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "People in Sumeru don't dream. What a strange phenomenon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119909"
            ]
          },
          "30119909": {
            "id": "30119909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay, Nahida said, \"The Akasha relies on the power of a Gnosis to operate, as it is the manifestation of the God of Wisdom's power. It compiles the wisdom of the entire populace, and it grants knowledge to the people.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119910"
            ]
          },
          "30119910": {
            "id": "30119910",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mercenaries rely heavily on muscle memory, and Dehya was able to use her experiences to avoid injury in later samsara cycles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119911"
            ]
          },
          "30119911": {
            "id": "30119911",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The beep is a prompt tone for Akasha operations. We still hear it every night, even though we removed our Akasha Terminals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119912"
            ]
          },
          "30119912": {
            "id": "30119912",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "All the bizarre spaces I saw outside the city had one thing in common: a lack of human presence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119913"
            ]
          },
          "30119913": {
            "id": "30119913",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Those spaces remind me of... dreams. Like the one I had in the Avidya Forest, except these have no sign of human presence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119914"
            ]
          },
          "30119914": {
            "id": "30119914",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Those spaces kept disappearing before my eyes, but as soon as that beep sounded, many more spaces materialized.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119915"
            ]
          },
          "30119915": {
            "id": "30119915",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Those dreamscapes kept vanishing, but as soon as that beep sounded, more new spaces appeared.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119916"
            ]
          },
          "30119916": {
            "id": "30119916",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "..Was that space actually the real world? But wouldn't a real space just randomly disappearing like that be catastrophic?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119917"
            ]
          },
          "30119917": {
            "id": "30119917",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "My impression is that each day in this samsara only ends at the sound of that beep from the Akasha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119918"
            ]
          },
          "30119918": {
            "id": "30119918",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That should be it... The flow of time is endlessly cycling within one single day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119919"
            ]
          },
          "30119919": {
            "id": "30119919",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "If all our memories of a day are erased at the end of that day, then we would unwittingly relive the same day again and again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119920"
            ]
          },
          "30119920": {
            "id": "30119920",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We are all in a dream. It isn't that the people of Sumeru don't dream. Rather, the Akasha is taking their dreams from them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119921"
            ]
          },
          "30119921": {
            "id": "30119921",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "The Akasha relies on the power of a Gnosis to operate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119922"
            ]
          },
          "30119922": {
            "id": "30119922",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "It is a manifestation of the God of Wisdom's power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119923"
            ]
          },
          "30119923": {
            "id": "30119923",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "It compiles the wisdom of the entire populace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119924"
            ]
          },
          "30119924": {
            "id": "30119924",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nahida",
            "text": "And it grants knowledge to the people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119925"
            ]
          },
          "30119925": {
            "id": "30119925",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They say that alchemical divination is the Dendro Archon's divine revelation. So then, if Nahida has referred to herself as the Moon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119926"
            ]
          },
          "30119926": {
            "id": "30119926",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Now that I think about it, wasn't \"illusions\" a hint that we're all dreaming?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119927"
            ]
          },
          "30119927": {
            "id": "30119927",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Now that I think about it, wasn't \"illusions\" hinting at the Sages' deception of Sumeru's people?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119928"
            ]
          },
          "30119928": {
            "id": "30119928",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That doesn't sound right... I need to carefully think things through...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30119929"
            ]
          },
          "30119929": {
            "id": "30119929",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hmm... I can't seem to cohesively piece everything together."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}